After deployment succeeds, register and log in, then click the avatar in the top-right corner to get RAGFlow''s API KEY and API server address. Before using RAGFlow, add models and set a default model under Model Provider.' WHERE id = 'RAG_RAGFlow' AND `remark` = '详细部署教程参考：https://github.com/xinnan-tech/xiaozhi-esp32-server/blob/main/docs/ragflow-integration.md
