UPDATE `ai_model_config` SET `remark` = 'iFlytek streaming TTS notes:
1. Log in to the iFlytek speech platform https://console.xfyun.cn/app/myapp and create an application
2. Select the required services to get the API configuration https://console.xfyun.cn/services/uts
