5. Supports real-time bidirectional streaming with low latency
6. Supports colloquial-style settings and audio parameter adjustment. Note: V5 voices do not support the colloquial-style settings
7. Supports real-time adjustment of volume, speech rate, pitch and other parameters
' WHERE id = 'TTS_XunFeiStreamTTS' AND `remark` = '讯飞流式TTS说明：
1. 登录讯飞语音技术平台 https://console.xfyun.cn/app/myapp 创建相关应用
2. 选择需要的服务获取api相关配置 https://console.xfyun.cn/services/uts
